<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sal Oppenheim  said it has issued</p>
<p>two million call warrants on dollar/mark.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $1.60		     ISSUE PRICE  13.55 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.JUL.97		 PAYDATE	20.JUN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $1.60		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
